@startuml
title Cd Player State Machine

[*] --> Stopped
Stopped --> Playing : insert disc / press play
Playing --> Paused : press pause
Paused --> Playing : press resume
Playing --> Stopped : press stop / no more discs
Paused --> Resuming : press resume
Resuming --> Playing
Stopped --> Stopped : no more discs
Stopped --> NextDisc : insert disc
NextDisc --> Playing : press play
Stopped --> Stopped : COMPLETION_EVENT
@enduml
